Add mt8186-mt6366 common driver for mt8186 series machine.

Signed-off-by: Jiaxin Yu <jiaxin.yu@mediatek.com>
---
 .../mediatek/mt8186/mt8186-mt6366-common.c    | 59 +++++++++++++++++++
